{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54473","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水与陆，两势作艟{舟朋}。\n陆有势形水（京本作「湖」）亦有，舟车捷力（京本作「利」）不相争，专在将能明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54473.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54473","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}